<title>JAPAN: Nippon Gasket - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Nippon Gasket - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  2.66		vs	    2.61</p>
<p> Operating	   73 million	 vs	   74 million</p>
<p> Current	    139 million	 vs	  165 million</p>
<p> Net		   78 million	 vs	   78 million</p>
<p> EPS		    7.19 yen	  vs	    7.18 yen</p>
<p> Shares		11 million	 vs	   11 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  3.75 yen	  vs	    3.75 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Nippon Gasket Co Ltd is a specialist maker of automotive gaskets.</p>
</text>
